translated_text:
Article 3

This Regional Regulation aims to:

a. ensure the fulfillment of women's rights so they can live and participate optimally in accordance with human dignity and worth;
b. prevent all forms of Violence against Women;
c. provide protection and a sense of security for women victims of violence and discrimination;
d. ensure the implementation of policies, programs, and activities for the protection of women by the region systematically, comprehensively, continuously, and in an integrated manner;
e. increase the commitment of the Regional Government in implementing policies, programs and activities for the protection of women; and
f. encourage institutions that handle the duties and functions of women's empowerment in the Regional Government and community institutions in the region to improve performance in efforts to protect women.

Article 4

The scope of this Regional Regulation includes:

a. rights of women victims of violence;
b. authority of the Regional Government;
c. planning;
d. Implementation ...

REGENT OF EAST KUTAI

d. implementation;

e. monitoring and evaluation;

f. reporting;

g. guidance and supervision;

h. community participation; and

i. funding.

text:
Pasal5

Setiap perempuan korban kekerasan mempunyai hak:

a. untuk dihormati harkat dan martabat sebagai manusia;
b. untuk mendapatkan perlindungan dari keluarga, masyarakat, Pemerintah Daerah dan Iatau pihak lain baik sementara maupun berdasarkan penetapan perintah perlindungan dari pengadilan;
c. atas pemulihan kesehatan fisik, psikologis maupun seksual sesuai penderitaan yang dialami Perempuan Korban Kekerasan;
d. atas penanganan secara khusus berkaitan dengan kerahasiaan Perempuan Korban Kekerasan;
e. atas pendampingan oleh pekerja sosial dan bantuan hukum pada setiap tingkat proses pemeriksaan sesuai dengan ketentuan peraturan perundang undangan;
f. atas pelayanan bimbingan rohani; dan
g. menentukan sendiri keputusannya.

