text:
Pasal 16

(1) SPM bidang layanan terpadu bagi perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan bertujuan menjamin Perempuan Korban kekerasan mendapatkan layanan minimal yang dibutuhkan.

(2) SPM bidang layanan terpadu bagi Perempuan Korban kekerasan, meliputi layanan:

a. penanganan pengaduanjlaporan Korban Kekerasan Terhadap Perempuan;
b. pelayanan kesehatan bagi perempuan Korban kekerasan; c. rehabilitasi sosial bagi perempuan Korban kekerasan;
d. penegakan dan Bantuan Hukum bagi perempuan Korban kekerasan;
e. Pemulangan dan Reintegrasi Sosial bagi perempuan Korban kekerasan; dan
f. dalam hal Perempuan Korban Kekerasan mengalami trauma atau penyakit yang membahayakan dirinya akibat tindak kekerasan sehingga memerlukan pertolongan segera, Pemerintah Daerah berkewajiban memberikan pertolongan pertama paling lambat 7 (tujuh) hari setelah pengaduan diajukan.

translated_text:
Article 16

(1) SPM in the field of integrated services for women and children victims of violence aims to ensure that Female Victims of violence receive the minimum services needed.

(2) SPM in the field of integrated services for Female Victims of violence includes services:

a. handling of complaints/reports of Victims of Violence Against Women;
b. health services for female victims of violence; c. social rehabilitation for female victims of violence;
d. enforcement and Legal Aid for female victims of violence;
e. Repatriation and Social Reintegration for female victims of violence; and
f. in the event that a Female Victim of Violence experiences trauma or illness that endangers herself as a result of acts of violence so as to require immediate assistance, the Regional Government is obliged to provide first aid no later than 7 (seven) days after the complaint is filed.

